Nethack has many little hidden bits that you may never encounter.  If you
are wearing a shield of reflection and are disintegration resistant, and you
offend your god, he will blast you with a lightning bolt.  The bolt will
bounce off the shield.  The god then REALLY gets ticked.  He blasts you with
a disintegration ray, which you absorb.  Then your god says "I dost not
believe it!" and leaves you alone.

